      "text": "    \n.equ PRNG_ADDR, 0x01 ; Port 1 is PRNG\n.equ SEED, 0x28        ; Initial seed\n\n        LDI  R7, SEED     \n        OUT  R7, PRNG_ADDR\nloop:\n        IN   R7, PRNG_ADDR\n        JMP  loop",
